{"product_id":"bleach-3-in-1-edition-vol-23-includes-vols-67-68-69-23","title":"Bleach (3-in-1 Edition), Vol. 23: Includes vols. 67, 68 \u0026 69 (23)","description":"\u003cp\u003ePart-time student, full-time Soul Reaper, Ichigo is one of the chosen few guardians of the afterlife.Ichigo Kurosaki never asked for the ability to see ghosts—he was born with the gift. When his family is attacked by a Hollow—a malevolent lost soul—Ichigo becomes a Soul Reaper, dedicating his life to protecting the innocent and helping the tortured spirits themselves find peace. Find out why Tite Kubo’s Bleach has become an international manga smash-hit!Yhwach and his Quincies have been sowing destruction throughout the Soul Society, although the royal palace might prove to be their last stand. The ultra-elite forces of Squad Zero will do whatever it takes to protect the sacred fortress. But when two unstoppable forces meet, what price must the world pay?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tite Kubo\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421596051\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 592\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434483671193,"sku":"Manga-A-4-9781421596051","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6839e526355a7_Bleach__3-in-1_Edition__Vol._23_Includes_vols._67__68___69__23.jpg?v=1748708391","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/bleach-3-in-1-edition-vol-23-includes-vols-67-68-69-23","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}